Package: rsageFigures
Title: Figure Conversion for R Sage
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("R Sage contributors", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "noreply@rsage.dev")
Description: Reads the 'ggplot2' figure that a piece of R code draws, rewrites
    it as a 'tidyplots' pipeline when every part has a known counterpart,
    and checks that the new figure shows the same data: the same rows, the
    same variables and the same summary values. Parts without a counterpart
    are kept as 'ggplot2' code and reported, so the R Sage assistant can
    finish them.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.2.0)
Imports: ggplot2 (>= 3.5.0), rlang, jsonlite, grDevices, stats, utils
Suggests: tidyplots (>= 0.4.0), dplyr, sf, testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
